      </nav>
      <h1 class="ed-title">Treadmill vs Exercise Bike</h1>
      <p class="ed-dek">
        For weight loss the two are closer than either camp claims, and the one you use more wins. For knees, the bike removes impact entirely — but walking is already low impact, and a treadmill does things for bone and everyday movement that a bike cannot.
      </p>

      <!-- Byline -->
      <div class="ed-byline">
        <img src="/authors/shaheer-ali-khan.png" alt="Shaheer Ali Khan, PhD" width="44" height="44" />
        <div class="ed-byline-text">
